IMPORT prelude

-- Interpretation Act 1984 (Western Australia) -- the one noun the part modules share.
-- Nouns only: no rules, no #EVAL.  The time module (wa-interpretation-time.l4) imports only `prelude` and
-- `daydate` and so declares its own types.

DECLARE `Kind of written law` IS ONE OF
    `an Act`
    `subsidiary legislation`
